{"sections":[{"projectFiles":"OUDS-Discovery-Tutorial.zip","estimatedTimeInMinutes":30,"kind":"hero","xcodeRequirement":"Xcode 26.5","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS provides components ready to be used, specified in Figma assets and preventing users to handle tokens.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"They are rendered thanks to the theme in use.","type":"text"}]}],"backgroundImage":"ic_component_intro.png","title":"Use your first OUDS components","image":"ic_component_intro.png","chapter":"Use of first components provided by OUDS"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"title":"Add basic components","stepsSection":[{"media":null,"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-1.swift","runtimePreview":null,"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"First, prepare the ","type":"text"},{"code":"ContentView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" by adding inside it a ","type":"text"},{"code":"ScrollView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"caption":[]},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-2.swift","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add such picker with three items inside."}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Now, let’s add radio buttons to let the user choose its gender."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The official components are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadio"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadioItem"},{"type":"text","text":", but the package has also a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadioPicker"},{"type":"text","text":" to implement quicky a group of radios."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This component can be replaced by your own."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The radio picker is defined by an array of values to display radio items associated to a tag, i.e. an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable"},{"type":"text","text":" thing shared through a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Binding"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Inside a picker the user can select only one value, not zero."}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-2.png","type":"step","media":null},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-3.swift","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a checkbox item with only two states."}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The radio picker is alone, it is the time to add below a checkbox. OUDS provides two components: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckbox"},{"type":"text","text":" which is a simple checkbox, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckboxItem"},{"type":"text","text":" which is a checkbox (duh!) with additional texts and icons."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The state of the checkbox is shared through a boolean "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"State"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In some cases you may need to use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckboxIndeterminate"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate"},{"type":"text","text":" if you want a three-states checkbox."}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-3.png","type":"step","media":null},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-4.swift","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose to add an instance of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSHorizontalDivider"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are also components who do not have any behaviors and are here only for visual rendering, for example dividers which can be horizontal or vertical."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A divider is, in the end, a stroke with a color. You will see later, colors in OUDS have two values: a light mode value, and a dark mode value. Here the divider can have a color which can change, or not."}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-4.png","type":"step","media":null},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-5.swift","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a switch item, it will be used as a trick to force the change of the color scheme for the view for our future operations."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You will then be able to see the automatic changes of colors when you switch the color scheme."}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With radio and checkbox, OUDS provides also switch elements (toggles). They can be alone ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":") or with texts ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwitchItem"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Just like the checkbox, the switch exposes its state through a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Binding"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-5.png","type":"step","media":null},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-6.swift","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSLink"},{"type":"text","text":" in the app and make it open the iOS documentation OUDS website."}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Users may need to navigate outside the app, like, for example, opening a website. Thus the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSLink"},{"type":"text","text":" component can be integrated. It can be only with a text or also a chevron indicator."}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-6.png","type":"step","media":null},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-7.swift","caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Let’s add a button with some rules: if checkbox is not checked it is disabled. When tapped, change the style of the button during 5 seconds."}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the end, we can also add a button. Button are one of the most used components in an app and bring a lof of the power and the style of the brand."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can find it with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSButton"},{"type":"text","text":". Such button has an appearance changing its colors, and also a style (loading or not)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thanks to the theme, the enabled, disabled, hover, focus or pressed states are managed."}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-7.png","type":"step","media":null}],"anchor":"Add-basic-components","contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We will work on a kind of formular using main OUDS components."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Feel free to style and design things as you want."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"mediaPosition":"trailing"}]}]},{"assessments":[{"type":"multiple-choice","choices":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"No! The components use the design specifications, i.e. tokens, thanks to the theme, to define the style they must have in all cases.","type":"text"}]}],"isCorrect":false},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"That is the reason why the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is so important: it injects the theme as environment variable so that any component can get it to define its style.","type":"text"}]}],"isCorrect":true}],"content":[],"title":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Does the developer using OUDS component need to manage the look and feel of the components?"}]}]}],"anchor":"Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessments"},{"action":{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","overridingTitle":"Get started","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}]},"title":"Add more OUDS components","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Components can be similar to iOS native components, or can also be original and strongly related to Orange Unified Design System needs."}],"featuredEyebrow":"Tutorial","kind":"callToAction"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"project","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/$volume","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS"]],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","modules":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies","sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}]}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Preparation-of-the-theme","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme#Basic-structure-for-the-app","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}]}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Add-basic-components","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}]}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Richer-and-more-original-components-of-OUDS","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components#Add-basic-components","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}]}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things","sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-tokens","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-view-modifiers","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Final-result","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Want-to-be-an-artist","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}]}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Go-further-with-more-ressources","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further","sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further#More-resources","kind":"task"}]}]}]},"metadata":{"role":"project","title":"Use your first OUDS components","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","category":"Orange Unified Design System"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components"]}],"references":{"tutorial-discovery-3-4.swift":{"content":["import OUDSSwiftUI","import SwiftUI","","struct ContentView: View {","","    @State var selectedGender: Genders = .male","    @State var termsAccepted: Bool = false","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            OUDSRadioPicker(selection: $selectedGender,","                            radios: genderRadioValues(),","                            placement: .horizontal(false))","","            OUDSHorizontalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","","            OUDSCheckboxItem(\"I accept the terms of use\", isOn: $termsAccepted)","        }","    }","","    \/\/ MARK: - Utils","","    enum Genders: String, Hashable {","        case male","        case female","        case nonBinary","    }","","    func genderRadioValues() -> [OUDSRadioPickerData<Genders>] {","        [","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.male, label: \"Mr\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.female, label: \"Ms\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.nonBinary, label: \"Other\"),","        ]","    }","}"],"fileName":"Content.swift","type":"file","fileType":"swift","identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-4.swift","syntax":"swift","highlights":[{"line":15},{"line":16}]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Want-to-be-an-artist":{"kind":"section","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Even if components increase the identity of your apps, it is not enough. Typography, fonts and tokens are here to improve that."}],"role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Want-to-be-an-artist","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Want-to-be-an-artist","type":"section","title":"Want to be an artist?"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further#More-resources":{"role":"pseudoSymbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further#More-resources","kind":"section","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further#More-resources","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources."}],"title":"More resources","type":"section"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components":{"kind":"project","abstract":[{"text":"Components can be similar to iOS native components, or can also be original and strongly related to Orange Unified Design System needs.","type":"text"}],"role":"project","url":"\/tutor